    "notes": "A GeckoLib geo model in Bedrock geometry format: a list of bones, each with a pivot and cubes. Units are pixels, 16 to a block, and origin is the lowest corner of a cube. head names body as its parent, so it moves with the body. uv is the top-left corner of the box layout on the 64x64 texture (texture_width and texture_height). Import a Blockbench model to replace it, or edit the numbers and watch the preview.",
